	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>InnerVoice records short pronunciation samples when you click Record in the Pronunciations list, and a voice to clone when you click Record in Clone a Voice.</string>
	<key>NSPrincipalClass</key>
	<string>NSApplication</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>InnerVoice finds the words in a recording you clone a voice from, on this Mac, so the clone knows what the recording says.</string>
